        "jsCode": "// AGGREGATOR NODE: Combine all items in the batch into a SINGLE request payload\n// This prevents the HTTP Request node from executing multiple times in parallel\n\nconst noticias = items.map(item => ({\n    text: item.json.prompt_para_api,\n    metadata: item.json.metadata_para_api\n}));\n\n// Construct secure callback payload\nconst config = $('Config').first().json;\n\nreturn [{\n    json: {\n        payload: {\n            noticias: noticias,\n            callback_url: config.WEBHOOK_URL,\n            webhook_token: config.WEBHOOK_TOKEN\n        }\n    }\n}];"
